@startuml planning_loop
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Sans
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "Game\n(engine)" as G
participant "Hook\n(C)" as H
participant "Executor\n(Python)" as E
participant "Commander\n(Python)" as C
participant "LLM" as L

== Battle start ==
H -> C : battle_start, terrain, town streets / walls,\nbridges and fords
C -> L : briefing: map, river, unit types,\nrules.md, strategy.md
== Every 0.5 s (no model call) ==
G -> H : game tick
H -> E : state (units, morale, targets, orders...)
E -> E : reflexes: keep range, engage,\nnew target, abilities, guards
E -> H : orders
H -> G : game's own order functions
== Every ~8 s (~4 s within 200 m of the enemy), when something changed ==
E -> C : latest state
C -> L : battle report + previous plan
L --> C : new plan (groups, tasks, routes,\nformations, reflex settings)
C -> E : plan
@enduml
